# Allowed module include edges: ADR-0007 §1 as built, checked by
# tools/check-deps.sh. "from -> to". Any edge not listed here or in
# module-deps.known fails CI. Add a line only with the ADR's graph in hand:
# an edge toward a higher layer, from drivers/* to engine/*, from ui/* to
# engine/* or drivers/*, or from contracts/* beyond common/base is a design
# change, not a list edit.
#
# Edges that exist only in tests/, testing/ or conformance/ (ADR §7: a
# module is tested against the fakes of its neighbours):
#   engine/core, engine/control, engine/plugin_client -> drivers/fake
#   engine/core -> common/platform   (test_session_plugins)
#   contracts/api -> common/model    (FakeEngine and conformance, not the
#                                     contract headers)
